Z||000009||tgowens||05-09-2000||01:45 AM||||Cliff is definitely doing a good job and I know it is a monumental one at that -- I too fell into the "sling the mud back" thing (but only for a second) -- it's nice that this forum is here and it sometimes just gets to me when someone comes on here and abuses it.<P>We all need to understand that it takes all kinds to make the world go around and sooner or later someone will get on here with nothing better to do than to try to rile us up -- thanks to all of you here for providing entertainment, education, and knowledge of the Fiero -- I have and will continue to enjoy the forums and we can all help Cliff tremendously by not falling into the "flaming" trap........||||reg||6
